{"version":1,"content":"<p>HOY處境劇《你的保安 李寶安》周一（26日）晚上8時首播，正面對撼無綫同時段的《愛‧回家之三代同糖》。</p><p>車婉婉、樊亦敏、歐瑞偉、何依婷、徐榮及容天佑等，今天（24日）出席《三代同糖》宣傳活動，於炎熱天氣下現身銅鑼灣街頭，為劇集造勢。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T12:41:44.814775+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T12:04:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T12:38:06.346606+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T12:38:06.346606+00:00","content_hash":"a72e71f8f4b998779c61f07f415312b7f708a3f62b90fc19b830985c6bfea75e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}